    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "No, it means for every 10 cards in the total sum of cards in your trash and the cards in your opponent's trash.  For example, if you have 12 cards in your trash and your opponent has 8 cards in their trash, the total would be 20. Therefore, you trash 2 cards from your opponent's security stack.",
        "question": "Does \"For every 10 total cards in both players' trashes\" mean for every 10 cards in either me or my opponent's trashes?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
